@catalog = http://localhost:5205
@orders = http://localhost:5206
@returns = http://localhost:5207
@customer = CUST-DEMO-01

### UI-only read of all 50 synthetic orders, including other customers for teaching.
### No customer header; remote mode still requires the backend transport key. Never an agent tool.
GET {{orders}}/demo-data/orders

### All 12 synthetic policies, including archived versions, highest priority first.
GET {{returns}}/policies

### Local loopback profiles. Remote mode also requires X-Observatory-A2A-Key.
GET {{catalog}}/products?query=shirts&maxPrice=40&take=5

###
GET {{catalog}}/products/83

### Vestiti rossi: totale modelli e pezzi sull'intero catalogo; massimo cinque esempi.
GET {{catalog}}/catalog/query?category=abbigliamento&color=rosso&inStockOnly=true&take=5

### Conteggi non limitati da take; prezzo massimo inclusivo in USD.
GET {{catalog}}/catalog/query?category=scarpe&color=rosso&maxPrice=100&take=1

### Categorie e colori realmente presenti. I colori multicolore non sono additivi.
GET {{catalog}}/catalog/facets

### Filtro non valido: 400 Problem Details, non una lista vuota di successo.
GET {{catalog}}/catalog/query?take=0

###
GET {{orders}}/orders/ORD-1042
X-Observatory-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

###
POST {{returns}}/return-assessments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Observatory-Customer-Id: {{customer}}

{"orderId":"ORD-1042","reason":"defect"}

### Explicit manual write: creates/reuses a synthetic draft, never a refund.
POST {{orders}}/return-drafts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Observatory-Customer-Id: {{customer}}
X-Observatory-Confirm-Action: true

{"orderId":"ORD-1042","reason":"defect"}

